message: >-
  If you use this software, cite this repository and the exact commit or release
  you ran. Cite the original model papers and data sources separately. No
  archived release DOI has been assigned in this metadata.
type: software
title: "Transition Engine: AI Transition and Wellbeing Simulator"
authors:
  - name: "Transition Engine contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sagearbor/ai-ubi-wellbeing-transition-simulator"
url: "https://github.com/sagearbor/ai-ubi-wellbeing-transition-simulator"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Research software for transparent financial allocation scenarios, extensible
  economic models, retrospective historical evaluation, and AI-assisted policy
  mapping. Policy responses are conditional on declared assumptions; software
  correctness and accounting checks do not establish causal policy effects.
keywords:
  - economic modelling
  - AI transition
  - wellbeing
  - policy scenarios
  - reproducibility
